space_elevator by quintopia, version 1_6_2
leaves size 2 trail later on medium to long tapes to beat waterfall3
got rid of 3cycle clears, may add one back later for first big clear to confuse defenders
interrupted rush to add more decoys on medium tape
clear loops end with exactly two closing braces to defeat triplocks
planned for future versions: more decoys if needed, backup attacks to handle timing attacks, second tripwire checks for fast-to-slow rushers, possible smaller first decoy to arrive at tripwires on time
the two minuses in the previous line are there on purpose

